From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thomas Glanzmann <thomas@glanzmann.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 07:37:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: gpu: apple,agx: Tell the two G17S layouts apart

Two allOf entries match every node with apple,agx-g17s:
- The M5 Pro hand-off entry wants one "sgx" reg and no board operating
  points.
- The J716c entry wants "asc" and "sgx" plus the operating-point tables.

No node satisfies both. The J714s, K114c and K116s GPU nodes fail the
J716c entry, and the J716c node fails the hand-off entry.

Apply the hand-off entry to a node whose only compatible is
apple,agx-g17s, and the J716c entry to apple,agx-g17c. Also drop the
second apple,agx-g17s in the enum of the non-coprocessor entry, which
dt_binding_check reports as non-unique.

Signed-off-by: Thomas Glanzmann <thomas@glanzmann.de>
(cherry picked from commit 8f418a490a97dfff028df87a191c65ae8fe0b3aa)
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/apple,agx.yaml | 6 ++----
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/apple,agx.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/apple,agx.yaml
index 7a1ef097a..80ec251dd 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/apple,agx.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/apple,agx.yaml
@@ -252,8 +252,7 @@ allOf:
   - if:
       properties:
         compatible:
-          contains:
-            const: apple,agx-g17s
+          const: apple,agx-g17s
     then:
       description:
         The M5 Pro GPU uses one MMIO range and two firmware mailbox roles.
@@ -323,7 +322,7 @@ allOf:
       properties:
         compatible:
           contains:
-            const: apple,agx-g17s
+            const: apple,agx-g17c
     then:
       properties:
         reg:
@@ -536,7 +535,6 @@ allOf:
                 - apple,agx-t6050
                 - apple,agx-t8132
                 - apple,agx-t8140
-                - apple,agx-g17s
     then:
       properties:
         reg:
